[3761]={["aftermath"]="Ghede directed another visit to Hamuul and noted that herbal knowledge could aid the coming work.",["atomIDs"]={"3761:description:1-80","3761:description:83-229","3761:description:234-354","3761:description:357-450","3761:description:453-502","3761:objective:1-74"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3761:completion:1-97","3761:completion:99-195","3761:completion:200-346","3761:completion:348-407"},["opening"]="Hamuul sought large amounts of soil rumored to carry powerful magic. Ghede handled the samples while the Circle tested the crater's potential.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather twenty soil samples.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered them on Elder Rise.",["sourceHash"]="81517dfa3ba0fd3ee505567f85734cf6fbe7a936710908a3c1f203e25db45cb3",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3762]={["aftermath"]="Hamuul warned that the requested work involved danger.",["atomIDs"]={"3762:description:1-66","3762:description:71-212","3762:description:215-334","3762:description:339-440","3762:objective:1-56"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3762:completion:1-70","3762:completion:72-192","3762:completion:194-233","3762:completion:235-328"},["opening"]="Pala knew the Circle wanted experienced assistance but not the research details. The referral put those questions directly before the archdruid leading the project.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to meet Hamuul about the study.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the archdruid.",["sourceHash"]="71520e9e0397f63bd2cd30245701931ef0ea88939ae55e6e85ba3a341d176921",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3763]={["atomIDs"]={"3763:description:1-66","3763:description:71-201","3763:description:204-334","3763:description:339-442","3763:objective:1-52"},["opening"]="Saelienne knew a vital Cenarion research project needed seasoned help, though its details were beyond her. Fandral was directing the work from Darnassus and could provide the explanation.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to meet Fandral Staghelm about the research.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="e6a093cbe53465675fd96afa18fc297cd8f4a3f545d3dfdefe0ece069940c30f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3764]={["atomIDs"]={"3764:description:1-80","3764:description:83-216","3764:description:221-349","3764:description:352-466","3764:description:469-505","3764:objective:1-76"},["opening"]="Fandral wanted reports of magically enriched Un'Goro soil tested against usable samples. Jenal would handle the logistics of twenty gathered portions while the Arch Druid kept to the study itself.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to collect twenty Un'Goro Soil samples for Jenal.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twenty Un'Goro Soil samples to Jenal.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="2ac0f163c42bdd7cbf76772c1cfa8c806b7e205ce4b052aeb2badd4a4493c9c3",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3765]={["atomIDs"]={"3765:description:1-45","3765:description:50-88","3765:description:90-154","3765:description:159-213","3765:description:215-258","3765:description:263-297","3765:description:299-374","3765:objective:1-45"},["opening"]="Argos had traveled to Stormwind seeking experienced help for his brother in distant Darkshore. Gershala waited in Auberdine, a long journey from the city streets where the request was made.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to find Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Gershala Nightwhisper.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="8a345913ae1dae359d36116ed3a5d3e36179d349492485b6f28e4e06197f0f44",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3781]={["atomIDs"]={"3781:description:1-107","3781:description:110-167","3781:description:170-269","3781:description:274-364","3781:description:367-422","3781:objective:1-97"},["opening"]="Seeds cultivated in crater soil had produced many potent herbs, including the little-understood morrowgrain. Fandral's voucher led downstairs to Mathrengyl, who could provide seeds for further cultivation.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the Seed Voucher to Mathrengyl.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Arch Druid's Seed Voucher to Mathrengyl Bearwalker.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="dd6e595962d0168d467766c829cb8abae3fc93a38f60423cbd10d9b8d52d7a7b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3782]={["aftermath"]="Bashana explained its initial twenty packets and the cost of producing more.",["atomIDs"]={"3782:description:1-107","3782:description:110-174","3782:description:177-299","3782:description:304-404","3782:description:407-462","3782:objective:1-60"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3782:completion:1-54","3782:completion:56-105","3782:completion:107-197","3782:completion:199-307","3782:completion:312-414"},["opening"]="Seeds grown in the unusual soil produced varied potent herbs. Hamuul wanted to understand the mysterious morrowgrain among them, and Bashana held the supplies for volunteers.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the seed voucher to Bashana.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the voucher.",["sourceHash"]="0489bebad854d34158f2d35a55e843ccfd2f33200e8450e946fa410dd12d5af5",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3783]={["atomIDs"]={"3783:description:1-49","3783:description:51-92","3783:description:94-105","3783:description:107-151","3783:description:153-212","3783:description:218-253","3783:description:255-376","3783:description:381-442","3783:description:444-457","3783:description:459-492","3783:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Umi finally had an invention she thought could match her friends' ideas. The secret mechanical yeti needed a fur covering before its planned fright could become an impressive reveal.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather ten thick furs.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the yeti fur to Umi.",["sourceHash"]="a49088baa0aae9d559ce907d4c0dca06e2817a592670c6d0f4236d630148200c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3784]={["aftermath"]="Hamuul welcomed the interest while warning that the work was dangerous.",["atomIDs"]={"3784:description:1-66","3784:description:71-212","3784:description:215-334","3784:description:339-440","3784:objective:1-56"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3784:completion:1-70","3784:completion:72-192","3784:completion:194-233","3784:completion:235-328"},["opening"]="Norman referred experienced travelers to Hamuul's research. The innkeeper did not know its specifics, leaving the archdruid to explain both purpose and risk.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to meet Hamuul in Thunder Bluff.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the research's leader.",["sourceHash"]="702fbe7e759eb7c43fbd7559ad117001c43bec052c9f311d6a875e20f1de0b5a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3785]={["aftermath"]="Mathrengyl planned to pass the morrowgrain to Fandral when needed. The Circle's stated demand remained constant, leaving further cultivation available.",["atomIDs"]={"3785:description:1-78","3785:description:81-166","3785:description:169-250","3785:description:255-325","3785:description:328-482","3785:objective:1-130","3785:objective:135-193"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3785:completion:1-94","3785:completion:96-174","3785:completion:179-316"},["opening"]="The Evergreen Pouch joined Tharlendis seeds with Un'Goro soil to grow herbs. Mathrengyl asked for ten morrowgrain and made himself the return contact, keeping routine batches away from the busy Arch Druid.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to cultivate and bring ten Morrowgrain to Mathrengyl.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered ten Morrowgrain to Mathrengyl Bearwalker.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="215097020f19ff0666da281a8039d89da11b17c5f633f292a34ed48572198196",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3786]={["aftermath"]="She accepted it for the research and said the Circle's need remained constant.",["atomIDs"]={"3786:description:1-78","3786:description:81-166","3786:description:169-250","3786:description:255-324","3786:description:327-444","3786:objective:1-130","3786:objective:135-193"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3786:completion:1-94","3786:completion:96-174","3786:completion:179-316"},["opening"]="Bashana supplied a pouch to cultivate seeds with crater soil. The growth was a trial rather than a guarantee, and enough resulting morrowgrain was to return to her while the archdruid researched it.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to cultivate and deliver ten morrowgrain.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the cultivated herb to Bashana.",["sourceHash"]="b45f422b5bae51d638900388bb9994dbe0253c84aa31e356a440f3ea71ed4946",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3787]={["atomIDs"]={"3787:description:1-20","3787:description:25-146","3787:description:149-246","3787:description:249-301","3787:description:303-393","3787:description:398-478","3787:objective:1-55"},["opening"]="Tannysa passed along a private summons from Quintis in Feralas. His interest concerned the Circle's morrowgrain work, with the conversation deliberately kept from Fandral.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Quintis Jonespyre privately.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Quintis Jonespyre at Feathermoon Stronghold.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="db069073b4fa3b6c315eeb950773f8822f022b6025164f154e45e067ee369916",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3788]={["atomIDs"]={"3788:description:1-20","3788:description:25-146","3788:description:149-242","3788:description:245-297","3788:description:299-389","3788:description:394-474","3788:objective:1-55"},["opening"]="Shyria conveyed a private request from Quintis Jonespyre. The druid wanted to discuss morrowgrain research associated with the Cenarion Circle, beyond the Arch Druid's hearing.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to speak with Quintis Jonespyre about morrowgrain.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="8e411809942e3aaec5893952f09c6b5c1f4d0e5749da6f0c37e55af293f796fa",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3789]={["atomIDs"]={"3789:description:1-66","3789:description:71-201","3789:description:204-334","3789:description:339-442","3789:objective:1-52"},["opening"]="Allison relayed an invitation to a research project led by Fandral. She could vouch for its importance without supplying its details, leaving the Arch Druid to explain the work himself.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to consult Fandral about his research project.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="5f24c807e481d932af42c1fee07b6af8fca73477bb9290414dc74cdbeaa1ccdc",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3790]={["atomIDs"]={"3790:description:1-66","3790:description:71-201","3790:description:204-334","3790:description:339-442","3790:objective:1-52"},["opening"]="Firebrew had heard that the Circle needed seasoned adventurers for vital research. The precise task remained undisclosed in the invitation, which directed volunteers to Fandral at the Enclave.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to discuss the research request with Fandral.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm about the requested aid.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="37f1363ea9c9836452bf7f35707a227566549985bd2722d0a3993abcee103b83",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3791]={["aftermath"]="The samples made Quintis uneasy rather than settling his suspicions. He expected lengthy research into morrowgrain and its possible alchemical uses.",["atomIDs"]={"3791:description:1-32","3791:description:35-217","3791:description:220-262","3791:description:265-379","3791:description:384-428","3791:description:431-495","3791:objective:1-68"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3791:completion:1-38","3791:completion:40-45","3791:completion:48-109","3791:completion:114-151","3791:completion:154-181","3791:completion:183-207","3791:completion:210-299","3791:completion:302-408","3791:completion:411-461"},["opening"]="Quintis questioned why the Arch Druid was using the Circle's resources to gather so much morrowgrain. His specialty in curses made reports of the herb's properties troubling, and ten samples could support his own study.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring ten Morrowgrain to Quintis.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered ten Morrowgrain to Quintis Jonespyre.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="5cec7c73070094a9814a4f47a4b9ceec6b4cd3ebc568e2fe84c8de4c9b6d890b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3801]={["aftermath"]="Forgewright set aside questions of motive. He considered the undertaking ahead a matter of common good.",["atomIDs"]={"3801:description:1-14","3801:description:16-42","3801:description:44-130","3801:description:132-246","3801:description:251-350","3801:description:355-388","3801:description:390-482","3801:objective:1-92"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3801:completion:1-133"},["opening"]="Franclorn Forgewright introduced himself as the architect behind the stonewrought method. He offered a key into the depths of his accursed city in exchange for assistance yet to be explained.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak further with Franclorn Forgewright about obtaining the key.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the introductory audience with Franclorn Forgewright.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="a2e65b2147ec9a92788f1803d87ecd2582fbe34d8b06e3f11174fc9b1fb97212",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3802]={["aftermath"]="The hammer settled into the monument's grasp and a small compartment opened at its base.",["atomIDs"]={"3802:description:1-79","3802:description:81-123","3802:description:128-259","3802:description:264-341","3802:description:343-400","3802:description:402-505","3802:objective:1-60","3802:objective:62-154"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"3802:completion:1-88","3802:completion:90-140","3802:completion:142-159"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Recover Ironfel from Fineous and restore it to Franclorn's statue.",["opening"]="Franclorn's design joined a lost hammer to a hidden key. Ironfel had to be taken from Fineous in the Hall of Crafting and returned to the statue at Thaurissan's shrine, where it would remain guarded against removal.",["pending"]="{actor} would recover Ironfel and set it in the statue's hands.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} restored Ironfel to Franclorn's statue.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="133d9f28941a7c41350aa242e0e1564343f9838f8b48900482fb0538192bf9eb",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[3821]={["aftermath"]="Sha'ni mourned the future she and Thal'trak had planned after their service.",["atomIDs"]={"3821:description:1-145","3821:description:150-281","3821:description:283-301","3821:description:303-317","3821:description:322-386","3821:description:388-436","3821:objective:1-82"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3821:completion:1-18","3821:completion:23-123","3821:completion:125-151"},["opening"]="Three weeks without word had left Thal'trak fearing for his wife. Sha'ni's mission concerned Firegut rituals, but his own post prevented him from searching.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to discover Sha'ni's fate in the Steppes.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Sha'ni.",["sourceHash"]="92f3223a6174f263a7521a60d3468d8d82f55b4d1c3d18a1a1cbbe49fe680877",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3822]={["aftermath"]="Thal'trak grieved the life they had planned and refused to find comfort in the ring without her.",["atomIDs"]={"3822:description:1-34","3822:description:36-62","3822:description:67-133","3822:description:138-193","3822:description:195-261","3822:description:263-347","3822:description:349-379","3822:description:384-411","3822:description:413-443","3822:description:448-490","3822:description:492-507","3822:objective:1-80","3822:objective:82-134"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3822:completion:1-22","3822:completion:27-67","3822:completion:69-85","3822:completion:87-124","3822:completion:129-145","3822:completion:150-169","3822:completion:171-207","3822:completion:209-241","3822:completion:243-260"},["opening"]="Sha'ni recounted her platoon's destruction and her own death during Krom'Grul's ritual torture. Her stolen wedding ring was to return to Thal'trak with her final message.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover Sha'ni's ring for her husband.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the recovered ring to Thal'trak.",["sourceHash"]="f8155b317bd55a178253e4a6c61a4a40a8cfcb83402b940285bd612e7f90416b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3823]={["atomIDs"]={"3823:description:1-55","3823:description:60-89","3823:description:94-167","3823:description:169-295","3823:description:300-319","3823:description:321-379","3823:description:384-437","3823:description:442-464","3823:objective:1-116"},["opening"]="Oralius linked the Firegut to Blackrock supply lines around mineral-rich Dreadmaul. His first orders called for reducing the ogre force before another strike.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to carry out the Firegut assignment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Oralius's first assault.",["sourceHash"]="fcb7476f123532f38a3590f57cb3f6569cc7ebf33471f8fc526f5f058337b104",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3824]={["aftermath"]="Oralius planned its display above the ogres and predicted panic, without observing that result.",["atomIDs"]={"3824:description:1-27","3824:description:29-61","3824:description:66-105","3824:description:107-229","3824:description:234-357","3824:description:362-391","3824:description:393-432","3824:description:434-467","3824:description:472-486","3824:objective:1-55","3824:objective:57-146"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3824:completion:1-25","3824:completion:27-37","3824:completion:39-167","3824:completion:172-196"},["opening"]="Oralius singled out Gor'tesh for the next phase. The leader ruled from a Blackrock structure west of Dreadmaul rather than the mountain itself.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover Gor'tesh's head.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the head to Oralius.",["sourceHash"]="eac2aab1d498400c32ab604b5b46238d21eb0a75457b2dc2327227bc3a233038",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3825]={["atomIDs"]={"3825:description:1-41","3825:description:46-105","3825:description:107-205","3825:description:207-274","3825:description:276-364","3825:description:369-416","3825:objective:1-74","3825:objective:76-120"},["opening"]="Oralius had mounted the head on a pike for the mountain's summit. He expected the display to scatter the remaining ogres, an outcome still ahead of the errand.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to plant the pike on Dreadmaul.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the summit display and returned.",["sourceHash"]="b90efdefc50876f688282e26bfc2c57702a44c46e0724e13f6325e26c36268cb",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3841]={["atomIDs"]={"3841:description:1-14","3841:description:16-44","3841:description:46-76","3841:description:81-173","3841:description:175-208","3841:description:210-261","3841:description:266-299","3841:description:301-365","3841:description:367-382","3841:description:387-486","3841:description:488-507","3841:objective:1-37"},["opening"]="The Moonweavers had rescued a nest after its mother died. Kindal offered an egg close to hatching, directing a prospective caretaker to Quentin at the Shimmering Flats racetrack for advice.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to consult Quentin about the rescued Sprite Darter egg.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Quentin in Thousand Needles.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="1872ca9695f1992e15948c0d552bec3adbfe5a5b47d96423fdb9ae789af5e254",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3842]={["aftermath"]="Quentin accepted the elixirs and began combining the protective components. The egg's health remained something the spell was meant to test and secure.",["atomIDs"]={"3842:description:1-21","3842:description:23-38","3842:description:40-136","3842:description:138-165","3842:description:170-205","3842:description:207-276","3842:description:278-384","3842:description:389-462","3842:description:464-510","3842:objective:1-60"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3842:completion:1-10","3842:completion:12-32","3842:completion:34-130"},["opening"]="Quentin thought the egg nearly ready to hatch but wanted to guard against hidden damage. Two Elixirs of Fortitude were the missing ingredients for a protective spell.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to obtain two Elixirs of Fortitude for Quentin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered two Elixirs of Fortitude to Quentin.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="1f50676ddae6b06a1aca6e1b12468acc211500fb4dbf16a738294d1e2e9539e7",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3843]={["aftermath"]="Agnar recognized a sprite-darter egg and acknowledged its timely arrival. Preparing food for the expected hatchling became the next concern.",["atomIDs"]={"3843:description:1-27","3843:description:29-100","3843:description:105-232","3843:description:234-373","3843:description:378-455","3843:objective:1-170"},["bridge"]="The protective ingredients had reached Quentin. He recommended urgent transport of the fragile egg to Agnar at Aerie Peak, leaving only an hour for the final incubation care.",["bridgeFrom"]=3842,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3843:completion:1-19","3843:completion:21-66","3843:completion:68-104","3843:completion:106-146","3843:completion:148-175","3843:completion:180-291","3843:completion:293-321"},["opening"]="Quentin recommended a final journey to Agnar Beastamer at Aerie Peak. The fragile egg could not survive more than an hour without the animal handler's care, turning incubation into an urgent trip.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take the Fragile Sprite Darter Egg to Agnar within an hour.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Fragile Sprite Darter Egg to Agnar Beastamer within the quest's one-hour limit.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="ba1d13ec5de43df6004527d92d52249310a90eb930d49c3d1caac69ca8632ac9",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3844]={["atomIDs"]={"3844:description:1-43","3844:description:45-208","3844:description:213-280","3844:objective:1-77"},["opening"]="A wrecked raft rested beside a pond too small to explain its destruction. The surrounding trees suggested changing water levels, while the pond itself might hold a clue to the missing owner.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to search the pond for a clue to the raft's owner.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the pond search for evidence of the raft's owner.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="9ecbc008f2b6cbb7f207f90eaed613359bd59487879d0573eb9c8b02fa9f3880",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3845]={["aftermath"]="Linken found the belongings somewhat familiar. Recognition remained incomplete rather than restoring his whole memory at once.",["atomIDs"]={"3845:description:1-54","3845:description:56-153","3845:description:158-209","3845:description:211-248","3845:objective:1-64"},["bridge"]="The pond search had yielded a pack near the wrecked raft. Its contents might identify an owner among the travelers at Marshal's Refuge.",["bridgeFrom"]=3844,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3845:completion:7-43","3845:completion:45-60"},["opening"]="A recovered pack offered a closer lead than the broken raft. Its contents needed examination, and the travelers at Marshal's Refuge might identify who had lost them.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to examine the pack and return its contents to their owner.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the recovered belongings to Linken.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="108432c262aff47b9cf6b2ca357494064e5f3473617aab8b8b63ff6e353e071a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3861]={["aftermath"]="After eating, the bird shuffled uneasily and drew attention to the ground beneath it. What lay there still had to be examined.",["atomIDs"]={"3861:description:1-9","3861:description:11-18","3861:description:20-27","3861:description:29-34","3861:description:39-46","3861:description:48-55","3861:description:57-63","3861:description:68-148","3861:description:150-218","3861:description:220-233","3861:description:250-320","3861:objective:1-69","3861:objective:71-151"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"3861:completion:1-10","3861:completion:15-68","3861:completion:73-123","3861:completion:125-165","3861:completion:167-191","3861:completion:193-233"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring special feed to the befriended chicken.",["opening"]="A chicken scratched at the ground as if trying to spell a word, then turned away before its meaning became clear. Offering special feed was the next attempt to answer that peculiar encounter.",["pending"]="{actor} would find special feed for the chicken.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} offered the special feed to the chicken.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="39358355a5f5e4d223bbf7068305c777f3fed1187abef38cff2dbb04a85f25a8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[3881]={["aftermath"]="Williden regarded the recovered food and equipment as preserving both the expedition and its people. The supplies offered a chance to endure in the crater, not a claim that its dangers had ended.",["atomIDs"]={"3881:description:1-68","3881:description:71-135","3881:description:138-306","3881:description:311-424","3881:description:427-501","3881:objective:1-89"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3881:completion:1-59","3881:completion:61-126","3881:completion:128-234","3881:completion:239-354","3881:completion:356-414"},["opening"]="Williden's non-aligned expedition had underestimated Un'Goro's dangers. Retreat from the southwestern and northeastern base camps left vital food and research equipment behind, threatening the work of the survivors.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover a Crate of Foodstuffs and Research Equipment for Williden.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Crate of Foodstuffs and Research Equipment to Williden Marshal.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="b0096fb0ce1e70396d7639563f003f84e9017cc7ef2fac3a10d31cf58fe5e2de",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3882]={["atomIDs"]={"3882:description:1-81","3882:description:84-133","3882:description:135-163","3882:description:168-278","3882:description:281-326","3882:description:329-418","3882:description:421-503","3882:objective:1-59"},["opening"]="Spark disliked digging even before Terror Run supplied living dinosaurs alongside the dead specimens sought. Marshal Expeditions still needed bones, and he would accept eight without insisting they come from excavation.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gather eight Dinosaur Bones for Spark.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered eight Dinosaur Bones to Spark Nilminer.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="5b55b7324e002c9d598eb2d19c196fa5dcca67a969d71c3d326ae78c5d2dc1c8",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3883]={["aftermath"]="Hol'anyee accepted the sample as enabling research that the stranded expedition could not otherwise have performed.",["atomIDs"]={"3883:description:1-75","3883:description:78-177","3883:description:180-258","3883:description:263-310","3883:description:313-373","3883:description:376-450","3883:description:453-498","3883:objective:1-110","3883:objective:113-165","3883:objective:170-235"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3883:completion:1-25","3883:completion:27-53","3883:completion:55-192","3883:completion:194-291"},["opening"]="Hol'anyee refused to let the expedition's retreat end its research. The Gorishi seemed alien to the crater's ecology, and a wall sample from their hanging-larva hatcheries might explain their presence.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to collect a Hive Wall Sample with the Scraping Vial.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Gorishi Hive Wall Sample to Hol'anyee Marshal.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="f179181582b1c78798337e255a7529b51b8c36e7fcbf782cfdefcbff80394437",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3884]={["aftermath"]="Williden recognized the returned journal among the many things the expedition had thought lost in Un'Goro.",["atomIDs"]={"3884:description:1-37","3884:description:40-136","3884:description:139-380","3884:objective:1-67"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3884:completion:1-31","3884:completion:34-113","3884:completion:116-159"},["opening"]="A mangled journal still named Williden Marshal as its owner. If its account held true, the expedition survivors had sought northern high ground after creatures overran their camps.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to return the journal to Williden Marshal.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Williden's Journal to Williden Marshal.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="18d20d3837638162644e6702ee15802fb3ee295d4901464a67074f40d1188090",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3901]={["aftermath"]="Sarvis ended his instruction by affirming the freedom the Forsaken had gained.",["atomIDs"]={"3901:description:1-109","3901:description:114-238","3901:description:241-301","3901:description:304-355","3901:objective:1-102"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3901:completion:1-106","3901:completion:108-264","3901:completion:269-298","3901:completion:300-331"},["opening"]="Sarvis raised the pressure of his trial from zombies to tougher skeletons. The Rattlecages offered another measure of a recruit's usefulness to the Forsaken.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to confront twelve Rattlecages.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Sarvis's skeleton trial.",["sourceHash"]="106b1298bf948fe26d764ebf455325abe82c759187f9141e92fe34f09e86fc6c",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3902]={["atomIDs"]={"3902:description:1-10","3902:description:13-84","3902:description:89-197","3902:description:200-242","3902:description:245-366","3902:description:371-415","3902:description:418-467","3902:objective:1-106"},["opening"]="Saltain expected more newly risen recruits and little equipment for them. Useful goods among Deathknell's boxes could outfit those yet to arrive.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to scavenge six useful pieces.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the scavenged goods to Saltain.",["sourceHash"]="adfe1efe63a3bccb1e1ab2e3cdf6ff29df15d667c33aa9c05fdd06afe60715a7",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3905]={["aftermath"]="Neals welcomed the news that the vineyards' grapes could once more supply wine for the abbey.",["atomIDs"]={"3905:description:1-69","3905:description:72-190","3905:description:195-254","3905:description:256-288","3905:objective:1-62"},["bridge"]="Milly's rescued crop still needed to reach Northshire's stores. Her manifest was meant for Brother Neals in the abbey's bell tower, where his interest in wine made the news especially welcome.",["bridgeFrom"]=3904,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3905:completion:1-17","3905:completion:29-59","3905:completion:61-173","3905:completion:178-236","3905:completion:238-284"},["opening"]="Milly's rescued crop still needed to reach Northshire's stores. Her manifest was meant for Brother Neals in the abbey's bell tower, where his interest in wine made the news especially welcome.",["pending"]="{actor} would carry Milly's grape manifest to Brother Neals.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the grape manifest in Northshire Abbey.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="f720618bf1c57274704398c598ad6c69413886b4ea9b23d2729dbfd8bfa6481c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3906]={["aftermath"]="Pyron's destruction exposed a deeper corruption instead of ending the concern. Thunderheart now feared something more insidious within Blackrock.",["atomIDs"]={"3906:description:1-56","3906:description:58-181","3906:description:183-228","3906:description:233-306","3906:description:308-375","3906:description:380-415","3906:objective:1-69","3906:objective:71-133"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"3906:completion:1-17","3906:completion:19-33","3906:completion:35-84","3906:completion:86-162"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defeat Overmaster Pyron at Blackrock Quarry and report to Thunderheart.",["opening"]="The elders sensed a disturbance among the elements. Thunderheart blamed a fiery spirit summoned by the Dark Irons for a threat to the land and directed the search through Blackrock's Chasm of Flame to Pyron at the quarry.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront Pyron at the quarry.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} defeated Pyron and returned to Thunderheart.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="5060c0869b2827f8988f77a630ae5d92e1a1c406e8efb22b576b2859a9b73825",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[3907]={["aftermath"]="The Tablet of Kurniya named Ragnaros. Alarmed by the fire lord's presence, Thunderheart questioned whether Kargath should fight on or retreat before a danger he feared might bring another sundering.",["atomIDs"]={"3907:description:1-59","3907:description:61-144","3907:description:149-198","3907:description:200-213","3907:description:215-226","3907:description:228-247","3907:description:249-273","3907:description:278-322","3907:description:324-377","3907:objective:1-53","3907:objective:55-129"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"3907:completion:1-46","3907:completion:51-61","3907:completion:63-69","3907:completion:74-152","3907:completion:154-179","3907:completion:181-193","3907:completion:195-240","3907:completion:242-320","3907:completion:325-386","3907:completion:388-476"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defeat Incendius and bring information about his master to Thunderheart.",["opening"]="Thunderheart believed Lord Incendius controlled the foulness within Blackrock but served a still greater power. The purpose of the hunt was therefore to discover that master as well as to strike down the emissary.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek Incendius and evidence of the power commanding him.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned from Incendius with the recovered information.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="ca83a6f544bad2ea380f882f96e319bf1179be469cffeaf743bc94c2857810b0",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[3908]={["aftermath"]="Donova agreed to temper the sword and asked why Linken had taken so long. His forgetfulness struck her as unusual for someone she knew.",["atomIDs"]={"3908:description:1-44","3908:description:46-95","3908:description:97-137","3908:description:142-181","3908:description:183-209","3908:description:214-222","3908:description:224-291","3908:description:293-347","3908:description:352-425","3908:description:427-461","3908:description:463-506","3908:objective:1-54"},["bridge"]="The belongings had reached Linken and stirred fragments of memory. He recalled that his sword needed strengthening and sent it to Donova by Winterspring's hot pools.",["bridgeFrom"]=3845,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3908:completion:1-40","3908:completion:42-119","3908:completion:121-160"},["opening"]="The recovered belongings stirred only fragments of Linken's memory. He recalled a sword that needed strengthening without remembering why, and directed it to Donova's tempering work beside Winterspring's pools.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take Linken's Sword to Donova.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Linken's Sword to Donova Snowden.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="3a9de31f6ab0807fd5972c260aa7a88262b2bab0fb36f2b8a9875e6d15bcf600",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3909]={["aftermath"]="Donova tested a vial and recognized the Videre Elixir. The examination established the substance before the next unusual meeting.",["atomIDs"]={"3909:description:1-17","3909:description:19-27","3909:description:29-35","3909:description:40-51","3909:description:53-70","3909:description:75-98","3909:description:100-125","3909:description:127-170","3909:description:172-209","3909:description:214-269","3909:description:271-351","3909:description:353-421","3909:description:423-502","3909:objective:1-47","3909:objective:49-149"},["bridge"]="The sword had reached Donova, but her tempering could not complete it. The next helper was difficult to contact, requiring a Videre Elixir that Gregan in Feralas knew how to obtain.",["bridgeFrom"]=3908,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3909:completion:1-64","3909:completion:66-71","3909:completion:73-90"},["opening"]="Donova could not finish the sword herself. Reaching the person who could required an unusual means of communication: the Videre Elixir, which Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas knew how to obtain.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to learn from Gregan how to acquire the Videre Elixir and return to Donova.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Videre Elixir errand and returned to Donova Snowden.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="2a62b3ab437c692dc2b676726093cda1ff71b40b5d15a1c6ac64138d3fcb8f7f",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3912]={["aftermath"]="Gaeriyan acknowledged how long it had been since anyone came to speak with him. The encounter confirmed the contact Donova had directed.",["atomIDs"]={"3912:description:1-84","3912:description:89-190","3912:description:192-220","3912:description:222-286","3912:description:291-357","3912:description:359-430","3912:description:432-452","3912:description:457-507","3912:objective:1-65","3912:objective:67-124"},["bridge"]="The Videre Elixir had reached Donova. She directed its use at Gadgetzan's graveyard, then a northward journey in the resulting form to speak with Gaeriyan.",["bridgeFrom"]=3909,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3912:completion:1-55"},["opening"]="Donova said the elixir would permit speech with someone normally unseen. From Gadgetzan's graveyard, the transformed traveler was to head north toward Gaeriyan in a rocky crevice, carrying Linken's sword.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to use the Videre Elixir and follow Donova's directions to Gaeriyan.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Videre Elixir meeting assignment with Gaeriyan.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="aaaea15723e9c7bab02da4b9f11e56466d8d23f4bf910445d3826ffee37d0d00",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3913]={["aftermath"]="The gravestone slid aside to reveal a depression fitting Linken's sword. The concealed place supplied the next step in its transformation.",["atomIDs"]={"3913:description:1-71","3913:description:73-137","3913:description:139-160","3913:description:165-221","3913:objective:1-71"},["bridge"]="The unusual meeting had reached Gaeriyan. His next instructions returned to the graveyard: resume life and press a distinctive gravestone to uncover its secret.",["bridgeFrom"]=3912,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3913:completion:1-93","3913:completion:98-178"},["opening"]="Gaeriyan pointed back toward a distinctive gravestone at the graveyard. Returning to life and pressing that stone were the next instructions in the sword's secret work.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to resurrect and examine the gravestone Gaeriyan described.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the graveyard return and gravestone investigation.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="02250a2e44475aff9e22bf18dd510455a95df86f53286097c1ce6b87ffbe1866",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3914]={["aftermath"]="Linken recognized the sword as finished but still could not recall its purpose. Completing the weapon had not yet restored the reason for carrying it.",["atomIDs"]={"3914:description:1-71","3914:description:73-96","3914:objective:1-60"},["bridge"]="The concealed place beneath the gravestone had transformed the sword in a flash. The superior weapon was ready to return to Linken, while the purpose of his journey remained unresolved.",["bridgeFrom"]=3913,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3914:completion:1-11","3914:completion:13-26","3914:completion:31-80","3914:completion:85-128"},["opening"]="A flash of light left the sword transformed and ready to lift again. The superior weapon now needed to return to Linken in the crater.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to deliver Linken's Superior Sword.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Linken's Superior Sword to Linken.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="74e78c5533e37784783703b7c5d73c964e258da80d45deb6f1ba1a75fc267515",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3921]={["atomIDs"]={"3921:description:1-45","3921:description:48-154","3921:description:157-185","3921:description:190-324","3921:description:327-361","3921:description:364-436","3921:objective:1-51"},["bridge"]="Sputtervalve's excitement had outpaced his care for the machine. Believing he had broken it, he turned to Wenikee Boltbucket for a repair.",["bridgeFrom"]=902,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Sputtervalve believed he had broken the device after exciting colleagues in Undermine about it. Wenikee's curiosity offered a possible way to repair the mistake.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to show the broken device to Wenikee.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the samophlange to Wenikee.",["sourceHash"]="1ed38bb87f58a6881af0add9b552a82b99167ebfdf096fe1a86d239aee76d431",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3922]={["atomIDs"]={"3922:description:1-79","3922:description:82-192","3922:description:197-256","3922:description:259-319","3922:description:322-446","3922:objective:1-59"},["bridge"]="Wenikee needed a particular gauge of nugget slugs. The company's tool buckets in the Sludge Fen offered a nearby source for parts.",["bridgeFrom"]=3921,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Wenikee lacked a precise gauge of nugget slugs for the repair. Company tool buckets in the Sludge Fen offered the nearest supply.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover fifteen nugget slugs.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Wenikee with the repair parts.",["sourceHash"]="f2b999117306d6b657165cbf5b4d31f32179ca3ade5e4f2598dc533915dc7790",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3923]={["atomIDs"]={"3923:description:1-23","3923:description:26-152","3923:description:155-232","3923:description:234-275","3923:description:280-330","3923:description:333-417","3923:description:422-498","3923:objective:1-74"},["bridge"]="The added gauges revealed how poorly the samophlange was faring. Wenikee stopped altering it and recommended Rilli Greasygob, whose company experience might be more useful.",["bridgeFrom"]=3922,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Wenikee's added gauges showed the device's integrity at a new low. Rather than risk more alterations, she turned toward Rilli's company experience.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to carry the battered device to Rilli.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it to Rilli in Orgrimmar.",["sourceHash"]="b15fb750102c051f0b136a583cfeb740003f5166cd97ac2a1176b5d27712bc85",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3924]={["aftermath"]="Rilli was eager to learn how to repair the device, but confirmed no completed repair.",["atomIDs"]={"3924:description:1-81","3924:description:84-262","3924:description:265-298","3924:description:303-380","3924:description:383-482","3924:objective:1-61"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"3924:completion:1-19","3924:completion:21-84","3924:completion:86-195","3924:completion:200-279"},["opening"]="Rilli believed repair was possible, but Copperplug had withheld the device's secrets. The manual and any scattered pages had to be recovered from his former rival.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to assemble the manual for Rilli.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the recovered manual.",["sourceHash"]="db209163cb3dfc29c483b9d5a83cb86a787b65bf3a9ab4a18e46e407e2cec1d2",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3941]={["atomIDs"]={"3941:description:1-11","3941:description:13-23","3941:description:25-69","3941:description:74-92","3941:description:94-137","3941:description:139-189","3941:description:191-263","3941:description:268-314","3941:description:316-416","3941:description:418-462","3941:objective:1-9","3941:objective:11-49"},["bridge"]="The finished sword had returned to Linken without restoring its purpose to memory. He thought J.D. might remember something said during his first confused arrival.",["bridgeFrom"]=3914,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Linken still could not recover the purpose of his journey. J.D. Collie had helped when he first arrived in his confused state, and might remember something he had said then.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to ask J.D. Collie about Linken's arrival.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with J.D. Collie in the cave at Marshal's Refuge.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="dc736fe7b0599d43bda88f99234cdbeae220b3d2391504fda073644644bdfdf2",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3942]={["atomIDs"]={"3942:description:7-13","3942:description:15-37","3942:description:39-112","3942:description:114-168","3942:description:173-314","3942:description:316-350","3942:description:355-397","3942:description:399-466","3942:objective:1-41"},["bridge"]="The inquiry had reached J.D., who recalled Linken talking about a totem and Eridan Bluewind. The next search led to southern Felwood on the strength of that memory.",["bridgeFrom"]=3941,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="J.D. remembered Linken speaking of a totem and someone named Eridan Bluewind. Felwood was the place she recalled, turning an uncertain recollection into the next lead.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to find Eridan Bluewind in southern Felwood.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Eridan Bluewind in southern Felwood.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="28af9490f199df5493f92f6b1d46083fad76dfdc3dbca1d3aa0a6c55164c0a8b",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3961]={["atomIDs"]={"3961:description:1-87","3961:description:89-235","3961:description:237-271","3961:description:276-298","3961:description:300-347","3961:objective:1-66"},["bridge"]="The completed totem had reached J.D., clarifying Linken's purpose against Blazerunner. She sent it to him in hope that its presence would help him remember.",["bridgeFrom"]=4005,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="J.D. now understood Linken's journey as an effort against Blazerunner. The completed silver totem might restore his own memory of that purpose if it were placed in his hands.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the Silver Totem of Aquementas to Linken.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Silver Totem of Aquementas to Linken.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="4013d579e7b508a7590f7e2806184b2c1ebf556ab4da542289af6ca0237da600",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3962]={["aftermath"]="Linken intended the Golden Flame returned to his homeland for protection against misuse. His thanks linked the recovered artifact with the recovery of his own identity.",["atomIDs"]={"3962:description:1-29","3962:description:31-67","3962:description:69-121","3962:description:126-155","3962:description:157-164","3962:description:166-224","3962:description:229-283","3962:description:285-409","3962:description:414-482","3962:description:484-506","3962:objective:1-54","3962:objective:59-123","3962:objective:125-190"},["bridge"]="The silver totem had returned Linken's purpose to him. He now asked another to face Blazerunner, remove the protective aura and recover the Golden Flame from Fire Plume Ridge.",["bridgeFrom"]=3961,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"3962:completion:1-14","3962:completion:19-136","3962:completion:141-196","3962:completion:198-242"},["opening"]="Linken remembered the last step of his journey but asked another to finish it. Blazerunner guarded the dangerous Golden Flame at Fire Plume Ridge; the totem could remove his protective aura before the artifact was recovered.",["pending"]="{actor} would use the totem against Blazerunner's aura and obtain the Golden Flame.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Blazerunner-and-Golden-Flame assignment.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="aaab0ccf619090c7430081d42199444919a6e8461d8d7306fb1984c751d96cb5",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[3981]={["aftermath"]="The commander urgently prepared to share classified information, allowing little time for questions.",["atomIDs"]={"3981:description:1-14","3981:description:16-41","3981:description:43-47","3981:description:49-100","3981:description:102-135","3981:description:140-158","3981:description:163-241","3981:description:243-354","3981:description:359-417","3981:description:422-436","3981:description:438-466","3981:description:468-491","3981:objective:1-44","3981:objective:49-139","3981:objective:141-192"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"3981:completion:1-25","3981:completion:27-47","3981:completion:49-109"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Find the imprisoned Commander Gor'shak in Blackrock Depths.",["opening"]="An arrow struck Gargal with a message attached: a drawing of an orc behind bars, signed by Gor'shak. Galamav suspected a trap but still needed someone to determine whether the commander lived within the Depths.",["pending"]="{actor} would search Blackrock's prison for Gor'shak.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Commander Gor'shak.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="ebb128a8947432b6cf19df35ada98da5fd1a870cafd3c603f9f751918b972aa2",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[3982]={["aftermath"]="Gor'shak warned that the alarm had exposed the intruder's presence and that further guards would come.",["atomIDs"]={"3982:description:1-45","3982:description:47-100","3982:description:102-169","3982:description:174-193","3982:description:198-264","3982:description:266-307","3982:description:309-371","3982:description:376-393","3982:description:398-402","3982:description:404-420","3982:description:422-435","3982:description:437-452","3982:objective:1-16"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"3982:completion:1-22","3982:completion:24-65","3982:completion:67-88"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defend Gor'shak when guards approach his cell.",["opening"]="Gor'shak claimed that he had allowed his capture on Thrall's orders to gather intelligence. His whispered report concerned Ironforge's missing princess, but approaching guards interrupted the disclosure and forced an immediate defense.",["pending"]="{actor} would defend Gor'shak against the approaching guards.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} defended Gor'shak during the attack.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="45ff6dacc7a990dfed455ed316db5d521eed92b570ae1459537d43164808ad75",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4001]={["aftermath"]="Thrall saw an opportunity to alter relations in the Eastern Kingdoms and insisted that the mission could not fail.",["atomIDs"]={"4001:description:1-95","4001:description:97-174","4001:description:179-274","4001:description:276-318","4001:description:323-461","4001:description:463-497","4001:objective:1-99","4001:objective:101-145","4001:objective:150-223"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4001:completion:1-93","4001:completion:95-115","4001:completion:120-160"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Consult Kharan about the princess and take the information to Thrall.",["opening"]="Gor'shak had gained the trust of Kharan, the dwarf held across the hall. Questioning him could clarify Moira's captivity before the report reached Thrall, whose plan depended on the princess returning safely to Ironforge.",["pending"]="{actor} would question Kharan and carry the intelligence to Thrall.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the information about Moira to Thrall.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="9dbb9d5e1f39086a8eb75345c7462ce43e9e4b3041b5d18d5298ffa97ca26780",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4002]={["aftermath"]="Thrall warned that the decision committed the agent to what lay ahead.",["atomIDs"]={"4002:description:1-36","4002:description:41-100","4002:description:102-192","4002:description:197-278","4002:description:280-373","4002:description:375-411","4002:description:416-432","4002:objective:1-76"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4002:completion:1-45"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Hear Thrall's proposed mission for aiding the dwarves.",["opening"]="Thrall judged Moira's situation an opening for future alliances. Helping the dwarves might spare later generations of the Horde another hopeless conflict, giving the proposed rescue a purpose beyond one family's crisis.",["pending"]="{actor} would hear Thrall's plan for the mission.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} accepted the next stage of Thrall's plan.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="7360d448f0da71b9677de1a326c0f9200f6784047ae8223fe559e9152016ff44",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4003]={["aftermath"]="Moira's horrified response challenged the rescue's expected welcome.",["atomIDs"]={"4003:description:1-112","4003:description:117-180","4003:description:182-220","4003:description:222-350","4003:description:355-370","4003:objective:1-87"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4003:completion:1-19"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Defeat Thaurissan while leaving Moira unharmed.",["opening"]="Thrall believed Thaurissan controlled Moira through magic and that killing the emperor would free her. His warning was absolute: even if the princess attacked, she must not be harmed.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront Thaurissan while protecting Moira's life.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} defeated Emperor Thaurissan without killing Moira.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="19ba92ba9ad4c207bf05686434d195f1ae101d1e1b5e40a490a87d0d589ad075",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4004]={["aftermath"]="Thrall feared a future Dark Iron ruler of Ironforge and withdrew to consult Sylvanas and Cairne. The mission's political meaning had changed with Moira's account.",["atomIDs"]={"4004:description:1-30","4004:description:32-86","4004:description:91-130","4004:description:135-210","4004:description:212-294","4004:description:299-394","4004:description:399-414","4004:description:416-492","4004:objective:1-17"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"4004:completion:1-69","4004:completion:74-111","4004:completion:113-222","4004:completion:227-304","4004:completion:309-325","4004:completion:327-365"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Report Moira's response to Thrall.",["opening"]="Moira called the dead emperor her husband and spoke of their unborn child, declaring that the child would inherit Ironforge. What had been presented as a rescue now carried consequences the planners had not anticipated.",["pending"]="{actor} would report Moira's words to Thrall.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} told Thrall of Moira's marriage and unborn child.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="a6d3fb649717b4b1f61e206ccf50c85b518b12e59c38360a757857a38d526011",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[4005]={["aftermath"]="J.D. confirmed the elemental's powerful aura and described earlier challengers being pushed from the ridge. The totem's purpose met a danger the expedition already knew.",["atomIDs"]={"4005:description:1-46","4005:description:48-107","4005:description:112-150","4005:description:155-308","4005:description:313-434","4005:objective:1-77","4005:objective:82-124","4005:objective:129-179","4005:objective:181-207"},["bridge"]="The claws and heart had reached Eridan. At Lost Rigger Cove's stone circle, Aquementas could transform them through the Book of Aquor into the totem needed against Blazerunner.",["bridgeFrom"]=4084,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"4005:completion:1-23","4005:completion:28-111","4005:completion:113-213","4005:completion:215-303"},["opening"]="Eridan sent the book, claws and heart to a stone circle on Lost Rigger Cove's easternmost peninsula. Aquementas alone could transform them into the needed totem, provided the summoner remained within that circle.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to summon Aquementas and take the completed totem to J.D. Collie.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Aquementas transformation assignment and delivered the totem to J.D. Collie.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="f95d8e1e53c00addaffe2c84df15a03f30d6877e7e368fff8e81435b5913a72c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
